WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.187 --> 00:00:01.770
EDWARD BENDER: So
Vimeo came to Fastly

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:05.270
looking for a new partner for
a CDN and for content delivery.

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:07.240
They had an existing
workload, a lot

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.740
of storage of media and
movies and entertainment

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:10.690
that they had.

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:13.210
We needed to find a new
home for this content.

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:15.420
Google being our partner
was the perfect fit.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:18.000
Ultimately, Vimeo is now
able to store their assets

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.380
on Google Cloud Storage or on
some elements on Google Cloud

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:23.360
Compute, go over
the interconnect

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:25.720
that we've put in place,
and deliver globally

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:28.080
at a speed and
level of efficiency

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.570
that they weren't doing before.

